--------------------------------- OVERFLOW CHECK VISUAL ---------------------------------

When do stacks overflow?

Array: [s1, s1, s1, ?, ?, s2, s2, s2]
                  ↑  ↑
                top1 top2

Condition: top1 + 1 < top2  → Space available
Condition: top1 + 1 == top2 → FULL (no space)

Example (size=8):
top1=2, top2=5 → 2+1 < 5? YES → Can push
top1=3, top2=4 → 3+1 < 4? NO → Overflow


